  "details": "Fig. 1, Box 1, string `Duration` is missing.\n\nFig. 2, Box 2, the `Delesect all groups` string is not used.\n\nFig. 2, Box 4, the tooltip for hovering on \"Share\" is `Select users to share this content with`. It should be akin to `Select groups to share this content with`, which is currently missing.\n\nFig. 3, Box 1, the currently used strings are `Content is too close to a user.` and `Content it too close to spawn.`, not the strings on Crowin, which reads `Content too close to another user!` and `Content too close to spawn!`.\n\nFig. 3, Box 2, the string `Press {0} to place content. Press {1} to cancel.` is missing.\n\nFig. 4, Box 3, the string `Shared by {0}` or `Shared by {0} {1}` is still missing\n\nFig. 5, Box 2, the `Delesect all users` string is not used.\n\nMinor issue: the string `You have already saved a copy of this palette` exists but is not used, and the game would still save duplicate copies of any content. Not sure if this is a bug.",
